<section xml:id="section-1-5" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
    <title>Optimization</title>
    <p>
        Optimization<idx>optimization</idx> is <em> application </em> of derivatives in a Calculus 1 course.  
        Fortunately, complex optimization problems are not part of the P exam.  
        You will however, need to recall the basics of optimizing a function.  
        Our review of optimization will be far less formal than in a calculus course.
    </p>

    <xi:include href="./subsection-1-5-1.ptx"/>

</section>